klyatva-legionera2-name = legionary's oath
klyatva-legionera2-desc = I am a Legionary.                                                            Legionary of the Great Empire of Therion!             Before the Empire, the law, and my brothers-in-arms, I swear an oath of loyalty.             I swear to perform my duty without fear or doubt, to obey the Emperor's will, and to defend the Empire from its enemies, both external and internal. I swear not to retreat before hardship, pain, temptation, or the threat of death. While my heart beats, I serve the Emperor. And even after my service ends, the name of legionary shall remain with me until the end of my days.

